---
import { getCatalog, moduleHref } from '../../lib/catalog';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const catalog = await getCatalog();
---

<BaseLayout title="Ruta" description="Currículo de Dart y Flutter desde cero hasta arquitectura.">
  <header class="page-head container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Mapa completo</p>
    <h1>El orden evita la magia.</h1>
    <p>
      Los módulos disponibles tienen lecciones completas. Los demás muestran el destino del
      currículo sin fingir contenido terminado.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="tracks container">
    {
      catalog.tracks.map((track) => (
        <section class="track" aria-labelledby={`track-${track.data.id}`}>
          <header class="track__head">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Ruta {track.data.order + 1}</p>
              <h2 id={`track-${track.data.id}`}>{track.data.title}</h2>
            </div>
            <p>{track.data.promise}</p>
          </header>
          <ol class="module-map">
            {catalog.modules
              .filter((module) => module.data.trackId === track.data.id)
              .map((module) => (
                <li class:list={['module-map__item', `is-${module.data.status}`]}>
                  <a href={moduleHref(module)}>
                    <span class="module-map__id">{module.data.id}</span>
                    <span class="module-map__copy">
                      <strong>{module.data.title}</strong>
                      <small>{module.data.summary}</small>
                    </span>
                    <span class="module-map__status">
                      {module.data.status === 'available'
                        ? 'Disponible'
                        : module.data.status === 'preview'
                          ? 'Vista previa'
                          : 'Roadmap'}
                    </span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))}
          </ol>
        </section>
      ))
    }

    <section class="future-roadmap" aria-labelledby="future-title">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Después de v1</p>
        <h2 id="future-title">El mapa continúa, sin lecciones a medio escribir</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="future-roadmap__grid">
        <article>
          <span>DART++</span>
          <h3>Lenguaje y plataforma</h3>
          <p>
            Isolates avanzados, streams bajo presión, metadatos, generación de código, interop, FFI,
            rendimiento y publicación de paquetes.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>BACKEND</span>
          <h3>APIs, datos y nube</h3>
          <p>
            Shelf, REST, autenticación, SQL y PostgreSQL, migraciones, transacciones, índices,
            Docker, observabilidad, CI/CD y despliegue en Cloud Run.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>ARQ/LAB</span>
          <h3>Una bitácora, varias arquitecturas</h3>
          <p>
            La misma feature con MVC, MVVM, Clean Architecture, Provider, Riverpod, Cubit y Bloc,
            comparada por dependencias, flujo y coste de pruebas.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .page-head h1 {
    max-width: 12ch;
  }

  .page-head p:last-child {
    max-width: 60ch;
    font-size: var(--text-md);
  }

  .tracks,
  .track {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .tracks {
    padding-block-end: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .track {
    padding-block-start: var(--space-xl);
    border-block-start: var(--rule-strong) solid var(--color-ink);
  }

  .track__head {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .track__head h2 {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .track__head > p {
    max-width: 55ch;
  }

  .module-map {
    display: grid;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-block-start: var(--rule-strong) solid var(--color-ink);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .module-map__item a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
    min-width: 0;
    padding-block: var(--space-md);
    border-block-end: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--color-rule);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .module-map__id,
  .module-map__status {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .module-map__copy strong,
  .module-map__copy small {
    display: block;
  }

  .module-map__copy small {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2xs);
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .module-map__status {
    grid-column: 2;
    width: fit-content;
    padding: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-xs);
    border: var(--rule-thin) solid currentColor;
  }

  .is-available .module-map__status {
    background: var(--color-acid);
    color: var(--color-acid-ink);
  }

  .is-roadmap {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .future-roadmap {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    padding-block: var(--space-xl);
    border-block: var(--rule-strong) dashed var(--color-ink);
  }

  .future-roadmap > header {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    max-width: 58rem;
  }

  .future-roadmap__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .future-roadmap article {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border: var(--rule-strong) solid var(--color-ink);
    background: var(--color-paper-raised);
  }

  .future-roadmap article > span {
    width: fit-content;
    padding: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-xs);
    background: var(--color-acid);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .future-roadmap h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .future-roadmap article p {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .track__head {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(18rem, 1.2fr);
      align-items: end;
    }

    .module-map__item a {
      grid-template-columns: 4rem minmax(0, 1fr) 7rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .module-map__status {
      grid-column: 3;
      justify-self: end;
    }

    .future-roadmap__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
